``deprecated-attribute`` is now reported when a subclass reads, sets or deletes
an attribute deprecated in one of its ancestors, such as ``self.curframe_locals``
in a subclass of ``pdb.Pdb``, unless the subclass overrides it.

Setting or deleting a deprecated attribute is not reported when the same
function also sets or deletes its replacement, such as ``sys.last_value``
kept in sync with ``sys.last_exc`` for compatibility.

Refs #11823
